g regularly for your business.",[],{"type":52,"text":81,"spans":82,"direction":55},"Our UK prices are based on parcel weight, delivery service and optional extras. We include £20 parcel cover on most items, with upgrade options up to £999.",[],{"type":52,"text":84,"spans":85,"direction":55},"Our NEW small parcel service gives you up to 26% off for parcels weighing up to 2kg and measuring up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm compared to a standard parcel of the same weight. ",[86,90],{"start":87,"end":88,"type":89},4,8,"strong",{"start":91,"end":92,"type":89},45,52,{"type":52,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":55},"Scroll down to see our Standard and Next Day delivery prices.*",[],{"link_type":97},"Any","card$5b57f3c7-7cad-4fc6-880c-713fc3fa07ac","card",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":101,"primary":103,"id":140,"slice_type":99,"slice_label":44},[102],{},{"CardImage":104,"CardAvatar":74,"CardTitle":111,"CardText":112,"ButtonText":137,"ButtonUrl":138,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":105,"alt":107,"copyright":44,"url":108,"id":109,"edit":110},{"width":64,"height":106},667,"Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx",{"x":71,"y":71,"zoom":72,"background":73},"Sending 40+ parcels a month?",[113,125,128],{"type":52,"text":114,"spans":115,"direction":55},"Get exclusive discounts on UK and international deliveries to help you reduce costs and grow your online business. It’s quick, easy, and completely free to upgrade to our Frequent Seller Account.",[116,124],{"start":117,"end":118,"type":119,"data":120},171,194,"hyperlink",{"link_type":121,"url":122,"target":123},"Web","\u002Ffrequent-seller","_blank",{"start":117,"end":118,"type":89},{"type":52,"text":126,"spans":127,"direction":55},"Simply send at least 40 parcels each calendar month, and you'll keep your discounts for the next month.",[],{"type":52,"text":129,"spans":130,"direction":55},"Already a Frequent Seller? Log in to your account to see your exclusive pricing when booking your deliveries.",[131,136],{"start":132,"end":133,"type":119,"data":134},27,33,{"link_type":121,"url":135,"target":123},"\u002Fsign-in",{"start":132,"end":133,"type":89},"Find out more",{"link_type":121,"key":139,"url":122},"d7f56684-a51f-45aa-b235-43a6a975fc18","card$588dea67-27ac-4211-8828-a1fbee6e5a56",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":142,"primary":183,"id":192,"slice_type":193,"slice_label":44},[143,148,153,158,163,168,173,178],{"column_1_cell":144,"column_2_cell":145,"column_3_cell":146,"column_4_cell":147},"Postable (Under 1kg)","£2.70","£3.49","-",{"column_1_cell":149,"column_2_cell":150,"column_3_cell":151,"column_4_cell":152},"0-1kg Small","£3.04","£3.90","£4.04",{"column_1_cell":154,"column_2_cell":155,"column_3_cell":156,"column_4_cell":157},"0-1kg Standard","£3.29","£4.12","£4.30",{"column_1_cell":159,"column_2_cell":160,"column_3_cell":161,"column_4_cell":162},"1-2kg Small","£3.52","£4.60","£4.52",{"column_1_cell":164,"column_2_cell":165,"column_3_cell":166,"column_4_cell":167},"1kg-2kg Standard","£4.79","£5.48","£5.78",{"column_1_cell":169,"column_2_cell":170,"column_3_cell":171,"column_4_cell":172},"2kg-5kg","£6.59","£7.55","£7.58",{"column_1_cell":174,"column_2_cell":175,"column_3_cell":176,"column_4_cell":177},"5kg-10kg","£6.68","£7.72","£7.68",{"column_1_cell":179,"column_2_cell":180,"column_3_cell":181,"column_4_cell":182},"10kg-15kg","£10.28","£12.35","£11.29",{"SectionTitle":184,"SectionSubtitle":185,"TableFooter":186,"InformationTableButtonUrl":187,"InformationTableButtonText":44,"table_header_row_blue":20,"table_rightmost_column_blue":20,"column_name_1":188,"column_name_2":189,"column_name_3":190,"column_name_4":191},"Delivery to a home or work address","Pay online prices","Next Day services are not always available. A £2.75 location charge may apply for some postcodes, unless the parcel is sent and delivered within the same postcode area (e.g. BT2 to BT18).",{"link_type":97},"Weight and size","Standard drop off","Next Day drop off","Standard collection","information_table_v2$6d408200-cda6-47f4-91e8-903d1a5dee6f","information_table_v2",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":195,"primary":210,"id":217,"slice_type":193,"slice_label":44},[196,199,200,201,202,203,204,207],{"column_1_cell":144,"column_2_cell":197,"column_3_cell":198,"column_4_cell":44},"£2.62","£3.20",{"column_1_cell":149,"column_2_cell":197,"column_3_cell":198,"column_4_cell":44},{"column_1_cell":154,"column_2_cell":197,"column_3_cell":198,"column_4_cell":44},{"column_1_cell":159,"column_2_cell":197,"column_3_cell":198,"column_4_cell":44},{"column_1_cell":164,"column_2_cell":197,"column_3_cell":198,"column_4_cell":44},{"column_1_cell":169,"column_2_cell":197,"column_3_cell":198,"column_4_cell":44},{"column_1_cell":174,"column_2_cell":205,"column_3_cell":206,"column_4_cell":44},"£5.87","£6.82",{"column_1_cell":179,"column_2_cell":208,"column_3_cell":209,"column_4_cell":44},"£9.01","£10.61",{"SectionTitle":211,"SectionSubtitle":212,"TableFooter":186,"InformationTableButtonUrl":213,"InformationTableButtonText":44,"table_header_row_blue":20,"table_rightmost_column_blue":20,"column_name_1":214,"column_name_2":215,"column_name_3":216,"column_name_4":44},"Delivery to a ParcelShop","Send a parcel up to 5kg for just £2.62 when you prebook your delivery online.",{"link_type":97},"Weight","Standard","Next Day","information_table_v2$1e12567b-47c2-49c8-b2d8-ea659c0d962c",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":219,"primary":260,"id":271,"slice_type":272,"slice_label":44},[220,241],{"Title":221,"Description":226,"Image":230,"Label":44,"UrlText":236,"Url":237,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":240,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[222],{"type":223,"text":224,"spans":225,"direction":55},"heading3","Standard delivery, from £2.62",[],[227],{"type":52,"text":228,"spans":229,"direction":55},"Our equivalent of Royal Mail Second Class. Standard delivery aims to arrive in 2–3 working days from drop-off or collection. Choose to drop off at a ParcelShop or Locker, or book a courier collection from home or work.",[],{"dimensions":231,"alt":232,"copyright":44,"url":233,"id":234,"edit":235},{"width":64,"height":65},"An Evri Courier is walking down the street in a residential area with a parcel under his arm.","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xb5bqstJ9-pU1_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0782.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69xb5bqstJ9-pU1",{"x":71,"y":88,"zoom":72,"background":73},"Send a parcel",{"link_type":121,"key":238,"url":239},"08c6272e-4cf6-485c-8bee-4e9040cafffc","\u002Fsend",{"link_type":97},{"Title":242,"Description":246,"Image":250,"Label":44,"UrlText":256,"Url":257,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":259,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[243],{"type":223,"text":244,"spans":245,"direction":55},"Next Day delivery, from £3.20",[],[247],{"type":52,"text":248,"spans":249,"direction":55},"Need it there fast? Our equivalent of Royal Mail First Class. Choose Next Day delivery and drop off your parcel at a ParcelShop or Locker by 12pm on a working day. We’ll do our best to deliver it the next working day.",[],{"dimensions":251,"alt":252,"copyright":44,"url":253,"id":254,"edit":255},{"width":64,"height":65},"A courier is outside next to an open garage door, carefully placing a parcel inside the garage as a safe place location.","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TxXJbqstJ9-UUn_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9893.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TxXJbqstJ9-UUn",{"x":71,"y":88,"zoom":72,"background":73},"Send Next Day",{"link_type":121,"key":258,"url":239},"7a1555ea-95ca-420f-a5d6-a3f2ff280a08",{"link_type":97},{"SectionTitle":261,"SectionDescription":266,"theme":270},[262],{"type":263,"text":264,"spans":265,"direction":55},"heading2","Your parcel postage options",[],[267],{"type":52,"text":268,"spans":269,"direction":55},"We have two cheap postage options for your parcels: Standard delivery and Next Day delivery.",[],"neutral","article_link_module$b1997725-dd08-44fb-b3bb-6856f6d85af4","article_link_module",{"variation":274,"version":25,"items":275,"primary":356,"id":359,"slice_type":360,"slice_label":44},"listComponent",[276,289,308,320,332,344],{"title":277,"content":278,"icon":282},"Tracking and notifications",[279],{"type":52,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":55},"Track your parcel online or with our app. With tracked postage, you can see your parcel’s journey from A to B. We'll also send updates to your recipient and a 1-hour delivery window at no extra cost",[],{"dimensions":283,"alt":285,"copyright":44,"url":286,"id":287,"edit":288},{"width":284,"height":284},40,"Track location icon","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":71,"y":71,"zoom":72,"background":73},{"title":290,"content":291,"icon":302},"Parcel cover",[292],{"type":52,"text":293,"spans":294,"direction":55},"We include free cover up to £20 (excludes Postable parcels, which are less than 1kg and letterbox-friendly)",[295,301],{"start":296,"end":297,"type":119,"data":298},42,58,{"link_type":121,"url":299,"target":300},"\u002Four-services\u002Fpostable","_self",{"start":296,"end":297,"type":89},{"dimensions":303,"alt":304,"copyright":44,"url":305,"id":306,"edit":307},{"width":284,"height":284},"Money icon","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":71,"y":71,"zoom":72,"background":73},{"title":309,"content":310,"icon":314},"Free printing",[311],{"type":52,"text":312,"spans":313,"direction":55},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for free using our Print in ParcelShop devices",[],{"dimensions":315,"alt":316,"copyright":44,"url":317,"id":318,"edit":319},{"width":284,"height":284},"Printer icon","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":71,"y":71,"zoom":72,"background":73},{"title":321,"content":322,"icon":326},"Divert a parcel",[323],{"type":52,"text":324,"spans":325,"direction":55},"Not going to be in? Your recipient can divert their parcel to a neighbour or safe place, ready to collect when it suits them",[],{"dimensions":327,"alt":328,"copyright":44,"url":329,"id":330,"edit":331},{"width":284,"height":284},"Neighbour icon","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F3736a9dc-2f90-4270-886c-46497bea535b_neighbour.svg","YeXP6xEAACIAnAxo",{"x":71,"y":71,"zoom":72,"background":73},{"title":333,"content":334,"icon":338},"Photo confirmation of delivery",[335],{"type":52,"text":336,"spans":337,"direction":55},"We'll take a photo as proof of delivery for your peace of mind, and so your recipient knows where they can find their parcel if it's in a safe place",[],{"dimensions":339,"alt":340,"copyright":44,"url":341,"id":342,"edit":343},{"width":284,"height":284},"Camera icon","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9ecd696f-d8c8-4a09-bdab-f2ed97d94895_cameras.svg","Yh96GBIAACkA-Zso",{"x":71,"y":71,"zoom":72,"background":73},{"title":345,"content":346,"icon":350},"VAT-registered?",[347],{"type":52,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":55},"Our standard prices include tax, which means your business can claim back on any UK parcels you send with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"dimensions":351,"alt":352,"copyright":44,"url":353,"id":354,"edit":355},{"width":284,"height":284},"Pricing icon","our-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.s